# Sibling-type resolution inside Common/ relies on this explicit index; a
# directory carrying a qmldir is no longer implicitly scanned, so every
# Common/*.qml type must be listed. qmldir.test.cjs enforces that.
#
# T3Socket.qml and HermesSocket.qml are deliberately absent, and must stay
# absent. They import QtWebSockets, which is an optional package
# (qt6-qtwebsockets-devel). Their connection singletons pull them in through
# Loaders by URL instead, so a machine without the package gets Loader.Error
# on that one object — an actionable offline chip — rather than a failure to
# resolve a registered type. qmldir.test.cjs carries both exemptions.

